# docs/guide/testing{,.ja}.md の `$ sober …` の塊（1 行 = 名前 + 空白 + コマンド。上から順に同じ作業場所で走らせる — s4-replay は s4-fuzz が書いたコーパスを読む）
s1-ok sober test kv2 --run TestParse
s1-fail sober test kvbug --run TestParse
s2-fail sober test kvbug --run TestRoundTrip
s2-ok sober test kv2
s3-cover sober test kv2 --cover
s3-mutate sober test kv2 --mutate
s3-after sober test kv3 --mutate
s4-fuzz sober fuzz kvbug --run TestAnyLine --time 5s
s4-replay sober test kvbug --run TestAnyLine
s4-after sober test kv --mutate
s5-sched sober fuzz kv --run TestCountAll --sched --time 2s
s7-test sober test settings
s7-wiring sober test settings --wiring
